WEBVTT

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:03.790
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:06.070
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:10.510
And with that, we'll continue last week's story!

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.890
It'll be filled with singing, friendship, and tears!

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.880
Will Yua-chan be okay?

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:16.890
She'll be fine!

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.630
Amu-chan'll solve her problems, no sweat!

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:21.720
So then, let's get going!

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:22.810
Doki!

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:25.000
Go, Yua-chan!

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:57.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.430
Wassup!

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.590
Wassup!

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.850
You're all here!

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:09.610
And now who you've all been waiting for. 
Please welcome Sakurai Yua-chan!

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:14.200
And without further ado, give it up 
for Yua singing "Secret Princess!"

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.760
It'll be okay. I can do it.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.440
What's the matter?

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:25.070
Hasn't the song already started?

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:26.200
Yua...

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:35.250
It's no use, I can't sing!

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:37.140
Yua...

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.260
Yua-tan?

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.410
Yua-chan, Character Change with me!

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.500
No, I can't!

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.060
Yua-chan...

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.730
Hey, isn't that...

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.570
Utau-chan!

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:57.570
Utau...

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:14.050
On an empty stage, the curtain begins to fall on the time for dreaming. {dare mo}

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.040
Yo!

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.630
Let Utau handle this, okay?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:28.680
Noticing you aren't coming again tomorrow, just like yesterday, {kinou}

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.730
Come with us backstage.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:36.150
the final scene is always painful and beautiful.  {rasuto}

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:45.950
But I'll wipe my tears and knock on the door. {namida}

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:49.160
Episode 86
Resound, My Voice! To Who I Used to Be!!

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:52.020
Don't let it get to you.

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:54.550
Everyone will think 
there was just a mix-up.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:57.670
Utau saved the show in the end.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:02.910
Yua, are you okay?

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:11.180
I can finally see your face, Senpai...

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.940
I give up. No more singing for me.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.230
Yua?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.410
You're quitting singing?

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.210
Yup.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.570
But what about your dream?

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:29.850
Yua, don't be discouraged. 
I'm sure you'll get another chance.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.090
It doesn't matter.

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:36.160
It's not like anyone believes I can sing.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:40.950
Yua...

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:48.640
Yua-chan-

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:49.830
Leave me alone.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.240
Can I have a sec?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.670
Well, I <i>was</i> trying to 
brood alone for a bit...

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.970
Are you really not 
going to sing anymore?

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.340
Nope.

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:16.170
Cecil-chan is always 
thinking of you, you know.

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:18.250
What's your point?

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:23.970
If you refuse to sing again, she'll disappear.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:32.150
Hotori-kun told you that Guardian Characters are 
representations of who you want to be, right?

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:38.340
When a Guardian Character is born to you, that means 
you have a clear idea of what you'd like to become.

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:45.560
It's a truly amazing thing.

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:51.330
Maybe you should try to be a 
bit more honest with yourself.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.880
Wow! We look awesome!

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:05.300
Yeah, check this out.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.840
Those are some great shots.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.390
Three, four, five...

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.300
Rima-chan, what are you counting?

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:14.440
There's one more picture 
of you than me!

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.880
Four for me, five for you...

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.880
It's all in your head.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:20.460
You haven't heard from Yua-chan?

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.580
No...

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.120
And we haven't seen Cecil-chan, either.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:28.130
And now, I'll sing "I am Here."

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:29.290
Cecil!

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.560
What's Yua doing?

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:37.290
Lately, she hasn't sung a single note.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.960
I guess she's still upset 
over the other day.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:45.830
But why wasn't she able to sing then?

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.970
Yua-chan can't sing in 
front of other people.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:53.150
She can only do it when she's by herself.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:58.930
She can't even sing in front of me. 
That's why I always watch her in secret.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:02.580
I like Yua-chan best when she's singing.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.880
Because that's her dream, after all!

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:13.930
But Yua-chan is trying to force 
herself to hate singing now.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:16.430
She wants to hate singing?

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:17.620
Why?

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:20.820
There must be an explanation;

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:24.350
a reason why Yua-chan can't sing in front of people.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.710
Amu-chan, isn't there 
anything we can do?

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.710
Yeah, Amu-chi! Have any ideas?

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.050
About what?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.490
Weren't you childhood friends-dechu?

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:37.770
But Yua said we only spoke one time.

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:40.320
I've been wondering about that.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:46.180
You only talked to her once, but she 
clearly remembers that conversation.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:52.950
But the words you spoke to me that day... 
They're still totally inside my heart!

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:58.290
Amu-chan, you believe in her, right?

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.380
You believe Yua-chan can sing.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:10.960
Yeah, I do.

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:17.140
Wait here. I'll do something.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:18.850
Amu-chan...

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:25.100
Wait, Amu-chi! I'm coming, too!

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.800
You got the last word 
in the end, Hotori-kun.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.270
Yeah, and it kinda irritates me...

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.530
I wasn't really...

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:39.080
Lulu, how about that kid?

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.250
No.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.780
Okay, then that one?

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:42.410
No way.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:46.490
Lulu, the last time the Embryo showed up was a while ago.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:48.220
If we don't get a move on, then...

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:49.860
Haste will get us nowhere.

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:54.410
In the same way, taking ? Eggs at random will not produce results.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.720
That's what all we've been through has taught us.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:04.390
I'm searching for a target who can produce a much stronger reaction than ever before.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:18.740
Why can't I sing in front of other people?

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:21.120
It happened then, too...

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:30.040
What's wrong?

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:33.050
I-I'm sorry!

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:36.160
Perhaps singing is not one of her skills.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.840
Well then, we just won't make her sing.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.010
She should do just fine as a model.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.150
Cecil-chan, cheer up!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:55.520
Trust Amu-chan and everything'll be all right!

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.370
Okay...

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:59.030
The best thing you can do right now

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.530
is sing your heart out and cheer up!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:08.250
Naturally, the King must be first-

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.340
Pepe-chan will sing-dechu!

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.510
Kusukusu!

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.910
Insolent knave! How dare you-

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.590
When it comes to music, I'm-

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:14.960
I wanna sing, too!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:15.670
Pepe-dechu!

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:16.490
Sing!

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:20.760
What are you doing? 
Cecil-chan is going to sing!

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.970
Where has Yua gone?

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.600
She wasn't in the studio...

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:34.920
...encounters a secret princess.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:42.990
I've actually always been 
searching for you.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:54.630
I don't think I could 
ever forget that night.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.270
What a pretty voice.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:47.790
Yua...

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.650
I can sing fine when I'm by myself...

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.410
Yua!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.380
Senpai!

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.820
You have a beautiful voice!

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:08.980
I sure wish you could perform 
in front of an audience!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.290
Yua, talk to us.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:19.790
There's a reason you can't sing, right?

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:27.440
I thought that when I saw you again... 
That this time, with you there, I could sing.

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:31.000
But I'm hopeless.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.170
I just can't!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.630
Yua...

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:43.660
But it's definitely faster 
to just keep nabbing eggs.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.220
That girl...

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.700
That there's the model, Sakurai Yua!

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:49.880
Model?

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:52.370
She's a huge star right now!

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.750
Color me shocked! Who knew we'd meet 
her in a place like this!

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.230
Nana, we're going after her!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.930
Oh? What, you want her auto-

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:00.790
No!

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:04.200
I'm sure she'll make a perfect target.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.690
Because I've got this song in my heart...

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.120
You're lost, aren't you?

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:28.950
You want to sing, but you can't.

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:32.660
So you wish you could hate singing, 
but you can't do that either.

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:37.780
This jewelry will grant that wish of yours.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:42.900
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:49.620
Huh?

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:51.520
What's going on?

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:54.070
The egg didn't come out...

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:56.130
What the heck!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.890
Lulu, try it again!

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.590
R-Right!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:05.370
I am the King! Bow before me, commoners!

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:08.900
The world revolves at my feet!

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.260
What is it?

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:11.060
What's the matter? My song...

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:13.900
Cecil-chan?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:18.040
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.430
Why can't I extract the egg?

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:24.450
Keep at it, Lulu!

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:27.000
I give up!

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.960
What's with that girl? It's not working no 
matter how many times I try!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.620
What a giant flop!

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:35.540
Hey, hold your horses!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:38.720
Cecil-chan, please come out.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.250
What's the matter?

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.690
Is it because of Kiseki's singing?

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.040
What did you say?!

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.220
She became a ? Egg!

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:56.830
Cecil-chan!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:03.530
And now, I'll sing, "Dark Desert!"

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.570
I wonder what happened to Yua-tan.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:19.000
I thought that when I saw you again... 
That this time, with you there, I could sing.

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:21.860
What could she have meant by that?

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.600
Amu-chan!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:25.750
What's up?

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.700
Cecil-chan's acting strange!

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.170
Cecil?

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:36.310
And now, I'll sing "Dark Storm!"

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:43.090
Singing... Singing...

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:46.110
She's calling me.

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:49.490
Amu-chi!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:50.350
Right!

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:54.050
Singing...

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.990
If I can't sing...

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:01.000
Then I should make music disappear...

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:06.130
Okay, just leave it to me!

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:25.240
Sun, sun, Mr. Sun!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.450
What's that?

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:40.290
It's a state of emergency! 
Get a move on!

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:46.050
Could it be...

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.090
Yua!

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:53.090
What are you doing, Yua?

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:57.440
Disappear, music, like you never existed!

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:08.190
Character Transformation: Bad Singer Dream!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:11.500
Yua-tan Character Transformed!

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:12.400
Yua!

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.770
Silence!

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.110
What is this noise?

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:24.000
Amu-chan, Character Transform!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:24.960
Right!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.000
Yaya, let's go!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.130
My heart:

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.470
My heart:

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:33.130
Unlock!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.020
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:50.540
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:56.300
Prism Music!

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:05.170
Prism Music didn't have any effect!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.920
Seems I had a good eye, after all.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.650
Except you gave up on her.

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:24.350
Colorful Canvas!

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.720
Now I'm mad!

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:32.830
Pepe-chan, let's go!

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:34.490
Our old favorite, right-dechu?

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.530
Secret Technique: Merry Merry!

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:39.280
Everyone...

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.490
Fall asleep!

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:43.500
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:52.150
Pipe down!

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:54.440
Yup, I figured as much.

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:55.630
Yes...

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:02.560
You'll never stop me, Senpai.

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:07.530
Yua...

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:11.220
Angel Cradle!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:17.990
Utau!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:25.770
Amu, now's your chance!

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:26.540
Got it!

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:29.540
How dare you sing in front of me!

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:33.830
Yua, that's enough!

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:34.750
Quiet!

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:38.930
Yua, you love singing, so why are 
you using music to hurt people?

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.970
I hate singing.

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.640
Yua, be honest!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.350
It's not about whether you <i>can</i> sing...

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:51.190
What's important is that you <i>want</i> to!

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:55.700
But no one believes I can sing in the first place.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:59.620
No one will even listen to my song.

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:01.370
That's not true! I will!

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:03.160
I'll listen to you, so...

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.290
What's the matter, Amu-chan?

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:15.990
I said the same thing before.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:18.770
I really loved that song, but...

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.090
That song?

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:25.840
But... no one would listen to me!

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:32.350
I'm Sakurai Yua from the Violet Class. 
Please enjoy my song.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:37.630
Sun, sun, Mr. Sun...

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:38.910
I can't hear!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:40.330
What's her problem?

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.030
Let's play outside!

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:58.350
I love to sing, but no 
one will listen to me.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.900
I will.

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:10.890
I'll listen to you, so...

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:15.110
I can sing?

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.570
Sure!

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.700
Yua.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.020
I...

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:42.210
Yua-chan, let's sing together!

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:44.480
Cecil...

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:47.620
I'd love to hear you sing again, Yua.

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:53.850
Senpai...

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.110
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.360
Open Heart!

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.000
I want to sing.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:39.190
I... want to sing!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:42.570
Yua-chan!

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:06.930
The way you breathe is mysteriously magical.

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:13.560
So gentle at first. Hey, whisper to me.

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:20.670
If you take a bite of the shimmering apple lying deep in the forest,

00:22:14.110 --> 00:22:15.690
She has a pretty voice.

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:17.170
Yeah.

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:25.920
the excitement will never stop.

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:35.030
With you as my wonderful escort, I'm a secret princess whose heart's aflutter!

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:39.130
Do you think glass slippers suit me?

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:39.440
Sorry I forgot you, Yua.

00:22:39.130 --> 00:22:41.840
Don't fret about it, just dance!

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:41.840
Well, we're even now, Senpai.

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:49.660
I'm a secret princess, so enchanted by that tuxedo.

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:46.860
I forgot how fun it was to sing!

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:53.760
I really do love it! I want to sing!

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:57.360
There's a heart tied to a tree in the garden so it can't escape.

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:56.090
More and more!

00:22:57.230 --> 00:22:59.390
I wonder how Yua-chan's doing.

00:22:57.360 --> 00:23:04.670
Until the toll of midnight's bell, look only at me.

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:01.940
And Cecil-chan, too.

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:04.980
Are the two of them getting along?

00:23:08.310 --> 00:23:12.370
I'm sure they're having a 
great time singing together.

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:20.340
Once you've pierced this heart, then we'll call it a night.

00:23:20.340 --> 00:23:27.520
We'll meet again tomorrow in my dreams.

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:30.710
Yua-chan, you ready?

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:31.660
Yes!

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:33.440
Let's go, Cecil!

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:34.460
Right!

00:23:50.850 --> 00:23:52.440
Guys, we've got trouble!

00:23:52.440 --> 00:23:54.900
I hear Nana-chan's sick!

00:23:54.900 --> 00:23:58.360
If that's true, Lulu must be worried.

00:23:58.360 --> 00:24:01.460
Okay, Amu-chan, open wide!

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:02.370
What the heck are you doing?!

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:06.100
We've decided to nurse 
Nana-chan back to health.

00:24:06.100 --> 00:24:08.340
And we're practicing on you first!

00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:10.430
So I'm your guinea pig now?!

00:24:10.430 --> 00:24:12.360
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.360 --> 00:24:15.000
Save Nana! Guardian Character Nurses, Move Out?

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:16.530
Everyone, to Nana's!

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:17.580
Go!

00:24:17.580 --> 00:24:19.390
Are you sure about this?
